# Welcome to my GitHub Profile!

My name is Zolboo, and I'm a junior developer currently working as an intern at the Institute of Astronomy and Geophysics of Mongolian Academy Science. I'm also studying for my Bachelor's degree in Smart IoT. 

## About Me

I've recently completed my capstone design, which you can check out [here](link-to-capstone-design). While my portfolio is a bit outdated, you can still take a look at it [here](link-to-portfolio). 

